nts as related parties, all contacts associated with the related party account can access the sold product.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/customer-service-management/add-additional-accounts-for-sp-relatedparties.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"task","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":2,"breadcrumb":["Adding related parties to a sold product","Using customer access management","Customer management","Use","Customer Service Management"],"tags":["#customer-service-management","#type-task"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/customer-service-management/add-additional-accounts-for-sp-relatedparties.md"},
